AI Smart Glasses - MCA Project

About This Project:
AI Smart Glasses is a smart device designed to help blind and normal people in daily life. It uses a camera and AI to see the surroundings and speak the information through voice.

Features:
1. Face Recognition - Identifies a person and tells their name
2. Text Reading - Reads text from boards and books and speaks it aloud
3. Object Detection - Detects objects in front and gives voice alert
4. Voice Assistant - Answers questions through voice commands

Technologies Used:
Python, HTML, AI Basics, Excel for Data Collection

What I Learned:
How AI camera works, How object detection works, How voice output works

Future Scope:
To test this with a real camera module and make a working prototype
